name: Public registry artifact management
description: Request ownership changes, removal from the registry, or provider source repository updates for a public registry artifact
title: "[Artifact Management]: "
labels: []
assignees: []
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Use this form to request administrative changes for a public registry artifact.

        Before filing, please try organization publishing first. This resolves many publishing and artifact management issues.
        HCP Terraform Public Namespaces: https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cloud-docs/public-namespace

        If you would prefer to make this request in private, please contact us via email at [Terraform.Registry.Support@ibm.com](mailto:Terraform.Registry.Support@ibm.com).
        Be sure to include the same information requested in this form to help us best assist you.

  - type: dropdown
    id: org-publishing-tried
    attributes:
      label: Have you tried organization publishing first?
      description: Organization publishing solves many publishing or artifact management issues.
      options:
        - "Yes, I have already tried organization publishing"
        - "No, I have not tried organization publishing"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: artifact-url
    attributes:
      label: Registry artifact URL
      description: Link to the specific provider/module artifact in the registry.
      placeholder: https://registry.terraform.io/...
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: source-repo-url
    attributes:
      label: Source repository URL (default branch)
      description: Link to the source repository for this artifact.
      placeholder: https://github.com/<org>/<repo>
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: input
    id: terraform-registry-file-link
    attributes:
      label: Link to .terraform-registry file in the source repo
      description: Include a URL to the .terraform-registry file at the root of the default branch.
      placeholder: https://github.com/<org>/<repo>/blob/<default-branch>/.terraform-registry
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: issue-description
    attributes:
      label: Describe the issue
      description: Describe the publishing or artifact management issue you are experiencing.
      placeholder: Tell us what is broken and why you are requesting administrative action.
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: reproduction-steps
    attributes:
      label: Steps that led to the issue
      description: Provide clear steps that led to the problem.
      placeholder: |
        1. Go to '...'
        2. Attempt '...'
        3. Observe '...'
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: textarea
    id: errors-and-evidence
    attributes:
      label: Error messages and supporting evidence
      description: Include the full error output and/or attach screenshots.
      placeholder: Paste error messages and/or add screenshot images.
    validations:
      required: false